@startuml sd_c1
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title C1 - Aircraft for other services
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
participant "flight-ops-n\n(replica of the caller)" as Caller
participant "aircraft-maintenance-local\n(Envoy of the same machine)" as Entry
box "aircraft-maintenance-k (a ready replica)" #F7F7F7
participant "InternalController" as Ctrl
participant "ViewAircraftForServicesUseCase" as UC
database "own database" as DB
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as Peers
Caller -> Entry : GET /internal/aircrafts/{registration}\n(Authorization: actor's JWT or service token;\nX-Correlation-Id)
Entry -> Ctrl : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
Ctrl -> UC : execute(...)
UC -> DB : find aircraft
alt held here
DB --> UC : found
Ctrl --> Entry : 200 + fields
else not held here
Ctrl -> Peers : same GET, X-Peer-Forwarded (in parallel)
Peers --> Ctrl : 200 from a holder (or 404 from all)
Ctrl --> Entry : 200 (X-Data-Node) / 404
end
Entry --> Caller : answer
note over Caller : no answer within 1 s (connect) or 10 s (read):\nthe caller answers its client 503
@enduml
